{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1516361-storyteller-s-vault-drivethrurpg-question","id":1516361,"title":"Storyteller's Vault/ DrivethruRPG question.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-27T13:53:23-07:00","id":1516361,"title":"Storyteller's Vault/ DrivethruRPG question.","content":"If I were to try writing up a Chronicles of Darkness module to sell, should I use DrivethruRPG or Storytellers Vault?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-27T14:18:11-07:00","id":1516364,"title":"","content":"STV unless you plan on pitching it to Paradox and hope for approval.<br /> <br /> Though STV is run on DTRPG's website so that's not a huge difference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-27T14:35:30-07:00","id":1516366,"title":"","content":"Yeah, STV is just the sub-storefront of the DrivethruRPG company that handles the Storyteller's Vault semi-open license.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-27T15:25:37-07:00","id":1516368,"title":"","content":"Apologies for sounding clueless, but I've been going over the Storytellers vault and it said to &quot;use templates provided by World of Darkness [Paradox] when creating your work,&quot; so I downloaded a template for Vampire: The Requiem. I then opened the template in WPS Office and the cover seems to be a bright fluorescent pink. I'm not sure what's happening here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-28T04:22:15-07:00","id":1516433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1516361-storyteller-s-vault-drivethrurpg-question?p=1516368#post1516368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apologies for sounding clueless, but I've been going over the Storytellers vault and it said to &quot;use templates provided by World of Darkness [Paradox] when creating your work,&quot; so I downloaded a template for Vampire: The Requiem. I then opened the template in WPS Office and the cover seems to be a bright fluorescent pink. I'm not sure what's happening here.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's ok... it can be a little weird getting into this to start.<br /> <br /> That odd about the template though, sounds like your office program is having issues displaying the graphics in the template properly. In those templates they usually provide some pdf templates as well, so you might have better luck in looking at one of those and maybe trying to adapt from that.<br /> <br /> Or, it could be you need to try a different office program.<br /> <br /> Good luck though! Hopefully you can get your project started soon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-28T06:16:18-07:00","id":1516447,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1516361-storyteller-s-vault-drivethrurpg-question?p=1516368#post1516368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... I then opened the template in WPS Office and the cover seems to be a bright fluorescent pink. I'm not sure what's happening here.</div> </div> </div> </div>The short answer is anytime you see the bright fluorescent pink that\u2019s where you\u2019ll put an image. Full page pink means full page art, and so forth.<br /> Back to the STV vs DTRPG upload, if you do it as community content you have to uploaded through STV in order to be able to tag it as Chronicles of Darkness. The option doesn\u2019t exit (or it didn\u2019t the last time I checked) to select CoD if you go straight through DTRPG.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-28T13:15:48-07:00","id":1516519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1516361-storyteller-s-vault-drivethrurpg-question?p=1516447#post1516447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The short answer is anytime you see the bright fluorescent pink that\u2019s where you\u2019ll put an image. Full page pink means full page art, and so forth.</div> </div> </div> </div>Doh! Totally spaced on them using that for spots where you're supposed to put your own graphics...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-28T13:29:15-07:00","id":1516522,"title":"","content":"I'm just not sure what I can use for Images. I'm somewhat struggling at the moment, and while the Storyteller Vault seems to offer a lot of <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?filters=0_0_45678_0_0_0&amp;page=5\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Resources</a>, I'm not sure how to go about using them. <br /> <br /> Big facepalm moment; I spent a lot of time designing some of my Chronicle's characters perfectly in Heroforge, but now I don't think I can use their images per the SV guidelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-28T15:57:47-07:00","id":1516540,"title":"","content":"The free art packs from White Wolf can be downloaded, extract the zip files, and then inserted into the Word doc. I think you can right click on the pink boxes and replace the images from there. I\u2019ve stopped making stuff for STV so apologies if my memory is off. <br /> <br /> There Hero Forge stuff probably can\u2019t be used. It\u2019ll depend on their terms to determine if you have publication rights to the images you create from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}